{"ref":"BDB, שְׁאֵלָה","hw":"שְׁאֵלָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאֵלָה</span></big>  [i. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁלָה</span>] <strong>n.f. request, thing asked for</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:24\" href=\"/Judges.8.24\">Ju 8:24</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאֵלָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:27\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.27\">1 S 1:27</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁאֱלָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:8\" href=\"/Job.6.8\">Jb 6:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁאֵלָתֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 5:6\" href=\"/Esther.5.6\">Est 5:6</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁלָתֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:17\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.17\">1 S 1:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁאֱלָתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:15\" href=\"/Psalms.106.15\">ψ 106:15</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>request, petition</em>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:24\" href=\"/Judges.8.24\">Ju 8:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:16\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.16\">1 K 2:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.20\">20</a> (both acc. cogn. c. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁאַל</span>), <a data-ref=\"Esther 5:6\" href=\"/Esther.5.6\">Est 5:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 5:7\" href=\"/Esther.5.7\">7</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָתַן</span> = <em>grant</em>), <a data-ref=\"Esther 7:2\" href=\"/Esther.7.2\">7:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 7:3\" href=\"/Esther.7.3\">3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:12\" href=\"/Esther.9.12\">9:12</a>. This passes easily into<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>thing asked for</em>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.20\">1 S 2:20</a>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָתַן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:17\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.17\">1:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:27\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.27\">27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 5:8\" href=\"/Esther.5.8\">Est 5:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:15\" href=\"/Psalms.106.15\">ψ 106:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּבוֹא שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:8\" href=\"/Job.6.8\">Jb 6:8</a>.—ii. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁלָה</span> v. infr. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, אֶשְׁתָּאוֹל\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_אֶשְׁתָּאוֹל\">אֶשְׁתָּאֹל</a> n.pr.m., v. p. 84a.","next":"BDB, מִשְׁאָלָה²","prev":"BDB, שְׁאָ֫לָה"}